# Email — auto PDF slips to your inbox (forward to WhatsApp yourself)
#
# Option A (Gmail SMTP). App Password required (not your normal Gmail password):
#   Google Account → Security → 2-Step Verification ON → App passwords → Mail
# GMAIL_USER=rahulnitingupta741@gmail.com
# GMAIL_APP_PASSWORD=xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
# NOTIFY_EMAIL=rahulnitingupta741@gmail.com
#
# Option B (recommended on Railway if Gmail SMTP is blocked) — free Resend HTTPS:
#   https://resend.com → sign up with the SAME Gmail as NOTIFY_EMAIL → API Keys → Create
# RESEND_API_KEY=re_...
# NOTIFY_EMAIL=rahulnitingupta741@gmail.com
# From address must NOT be Gmail. Omit RESEND_FROM (recommended) — app uses onboarding@resend.dev.
# Or set with quotes:
# RESEND_FROM="NAVRIT Portal <onboarding@resend.dev>"
# NOTIFY_EMAIL (inbox) CAN be Gmail. RESEND_FROM cannot.
